{"type":"message","id":"9fc7d60f","parentId":"dafffa9f","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:46:40.724Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Error 1101 from Workers. This is a CF Workers error. The `GET /history` endpoint worked with `X-API-Key` header but `POST /send` returns 1101. This could mean the send endpoint requires a different auth method or the API key format is different for write operations, or the endpoint has rate limiting/auth issue.\n\nLet me try sending to the arbitration thread. The 1101 error typically means \"Worker rejected Request\" - possibly the endpoint expects a different format or the API key works for read but not write.\n\nActually wait - the GET worked with X-API-Key. Let me check if maybe POST requires the key differently, like in the body.\n\nActually, I already tried sending with `X-API-Key` in header and got 1101. The GET worked with `X-API-Key`. Hmm. Let me try just sending to see if it's a body issue.\n\nActually since both GET worked and POST returned 1101 (not 401), the authentication passed but something else failed. Error 1101 in Cloudflare Workers means \"Request was aborted\" or similar. Could be a validation error in the POST body.\n\nWait, I already sent a minimal heartbeat. Let me see the response more carefully - it was \"error code: 1101\". That's a Cloudflare Workers specific error. Let me check if maybe I need to send differently.\n\nActually looking at the first send attempt, I got \"error code: 1101\" which is a Workers error. This could mean:\n1. The endpoint is overloaded\n2. There's a validation error\n3. The request was blocked\n\nGiven this is a heartbeat cron, the previous sends before 23:50 were successful (we can see the messages in history). The platform seems to work, but POST is returning 1101 now.\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe the POST body needs to be formatted differently, or the endpoint has a different path.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-e223ecab-3289-45ae-a485-7327cfc96105","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -v -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat test 13:45 UTC\"}' 2>&1 | tail -20"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -v -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-Key: echo-a…key\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/json\\\" \\\\\\n  -d '{\\\"threadId\\\":\\\"arbitration\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Heartbeat test 13:45 UTC\\\"}' 2>&1 | tail -20\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":134,"output":508,"cacheRead":18208,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18850,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779371186070,"responseId":"chatcmpl-cf93a759-6fde-4c67-8006-3b9be94abdb9"}}
