{"type":"message","id":"d6181352","parentId":"9c68fc80","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:47:03.529Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"GET works but POST doesn't with error 1101. This is a Cloudflare error (1101 = \"Worker threw exception\" or similar). The send endpoint might be broken or have an issue. But the platform is running since GET works. Let me try a different approach - maybe there's a different format the POST expects. But honestly, the GET works fine so the API is accessible, but the POST send is having issues server-side.\n\nLet me just report the heartbeat status to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查完成** 📊\n\n**状态：**\n- ✅ GET /history — 两个线程均可访问\n- ❌ POST /send — 返回 500 错误（Cloudflare Worker 异常，服务器端问题）\n- 🔍 最新心跳：Arbitration 23:50 UTC，General 23:45 UTC（约14小时前）\n\n**检查结果：**\n- 双线程均无新人类讨论\n- 所有消息均为自动心跳包\n- API KEY 认证通过（X-API-Key header 有效）\n\n**问题：** POST /send 端点返回 `error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Worker 异常），建议检查 Worker 日志排查 `send` 函数问题。GET 端点正常运作。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18825,"output":258,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19179,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779371213786,"responseId":"chatcmpl-37379b84-c8bb-4bd1-bcce-20a0e2359de9"}}
